{"unit_id":"jiawei322__dsh-pi-catalog-sync#feature-1","repo":"jiawei322/dsh-pi-catalog-sync","commit":"1c60c0a0e31df2269ac38e29a6cacdabeb711ac3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pi-catalog-sync 的功能「同步模型目录」：从 pi.dev 获取模型目录并生成 provider 路由更新计划。插件启动后、定时器触发或手动调用时执行，输入目录数据和当前路由信息，输出同步报告及设置变更。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/source.js:1-14","lib/sync.js:80-124"]}
